{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S01、S05等短停留段落中，未标记的感受词也比较密集，纵向交替阅读不如X左右分栏来得顺手，容易增加扫读负担。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的关键短语加亮，让我能迅速抓住每段人物心理的核心；感受词按音乐时机出现，也让我更容易跟上情绪具体如何变化，而不是只得到几个笼统的情绪标签。更重要的是，Y保留了人物从害怕给对方负担、逐渐相信彼此需要、享受亲近，到越来越害怕失去的细腻递进，前后心理变化更完整。X的文字更紧凑、阅读路径更直接，但部分心理转折和音乐细节被压缩了，所以综合体验我选Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fea3714a-f938-4b55-9924-1bac161923b7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T061716573510Z", "elapsed_seconds": 78.469, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T06:18:35.080036+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "396e335a4c3fd749dfafbe9af98cb2afcb50842e86f169161e8e8f7f4d72384f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt